# -*- mode: snippet -*-
# name: Loop — filtra e raccogli senza mutare la sequenza
# key: g-loop
# group: Idiomi
# expand-env: ((yas-indent-line 'fixed))
# --
;; COLLECT accumula i risultati in ordine di visita.
(loop for ${1:value} in ${2:'(1 2 3 4)}
      when (evenp $1)
        collect (* $1 $1))$0
